<title>USA: Reinsurance Group in Malaysian venture.</title>
<headline>Reinsurance Group in Malaysian venture.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reinsurance Group of America Inc said Friday it has entered into a joint venture to form the first life reinsurance company in Malaysia.</p>
<p>Reinsurance Group will own 30 percent of the new company, Malaysian Life Reinsurance Group Berhad, which will be based in Kuala Lumpur, the company said.</p>
<p>The remainder of the company will be owned by the 18 member companies of the Life Insurance Association of Malaysia, the company said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
